# PROVENANCE: Synthetic regression converted from the former unit test
# test_reader_frame_cycle_repeats_after_field_off. A full reader cycle over raw
# ISO-DEP frames (RATS, ISO select, native select, GetFileSettings, ReadData,
# native select of the PICC, DESELECT with CID) behaves identically on a second
# activation after the field drops.
name: A raw ISO-DEP reader cycle repeats after field-off
case-id: vecc-iso-dep-frame-cycle-repeats
origin: synthetic
feature-version: 6
source: converted from tests/test_dfc_virtual_picc_core.c#/reader-frame-cycle-repeats-after-field-off
